{
  "id": "frosted-glass-lens",
  "name": "Frosted Glass Lens",
  "url": "shaders/frosted-glass-lens.wgsl",
  "description": "Frosted lens with a Beckmann microfacet scatter lobe and depth-dependent frost thickness (far geometry frosts first). Frost forward-scatters in a Henyey-Greenstein two-ring halo with veiling glare; the clear window is a polished meniscus whose rim refracts radially and glints. ACES, bounded click frost-clear fronts and dataTextureC frost memory.",
